Backend/public/uploads/

# Documentation
#
# `*.md` here was silently discarding real project documentation: the design
# specification in Frontend/docs/design/, SETUP.md, and
# several files in Documents/. None of it was ever committed and nobody noticed, because
# an ignored file produces no warning.
#
# The rule is kept so stray scratch notes at the repo root stay out, but every directory
# that holds deliberate documentation is exempted below.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!SETUP.md
!setup_guide.md
!task.md
!implementation_plan.md

# Deliberate documentation trees — these are project deliverables, not scratch files.
!Documents/**
!Frontend/docs/**
!Database/**/*.md

# Microsoft Office Temp Files
~$*

# Generated Files
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx
